 * </pre>
 * Whereas, "struct sparse" is:
 * <pre>
 * struct sparse {
 * char offset[12];   // offset 0
 * char numbytes[12]; // offset 12
 * };
 * </pre>
 *
 * <p>
 * The C structure for a xstar (Jörg Schilling star) Tar Entry's header is:
 * <pre>
