    /**
     * Gets the uncompressed size of the entry data.
     *
     * <p><b>Note</b>: {@link ZipArchiveInputStream} may create
     * entries that return {@link #SIZE_UNKNOWN SIZE_UNKNOWN} as long
     * as the entry hasn't been read completely.</p>
